<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Nov 16.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Nov 16.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL ALAM</p>
<p>- King Hassan II receives a message from Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi.</p>
<p>AL ITTIHAD AL ICHTIRAQI</p>
<p>- Opposition leader Abderahmane Youssouffi says Moroccan people expect the next government to be elected in a fair and transparent poll.</p>
<p>AL ANBAA</p>
<p>- Morocco celebrates the triumphant return of late king Mohammed V and the royal family from exil in November 16, 1955.</p>
